  "abstract": "This experiment tests a novel paradigm: predicting the change (delta) in neural activity rather than its absolute value. The SOTA Fourier Forecaster architecture is modified to output a sequence of predicted deltas. A final integration layer (cumulative sum) is added to construct the absolute forecast before returning the result. The hypothesis is that by focusing on learning the dynamics of change, the model can achieve a new state-of-the-art performance. This is a high-risk, high-reward attempt at a new breakthrough.",
